<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3898/03  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8200/15  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0550/60  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5060/70  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     37.68/70   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.1415/35  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1778.3/9.3 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     117.56/61  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.9595/45  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.5833/53  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.9464/84  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6088/98</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$325.80/30</p>
</text>
